g_id":"b9398200-f89d-4e99-9727-90a15b1281d9","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"バイナリサーチのlog nの速度があれば十分だと思うけど。もちろんVim scriptが遅いのはそうだけど、log nアルゴリズムに簡単に勝てると思わない","ts":"1634773239.178900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U02BDFBM620"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Sls"}]},{"client_msg_id":"581c4e33-9209-4a78-84fd-4b21e438057d","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"具体的な数字をくださいな","ts":"1634773156.177000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J0sQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5091bdf2-0160-4727-9354-954ebbd0f944","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"遅いにしても、もうちょっと具体的な話をしてくれないとさっぱり分からない","ts":"1634773150.176500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L/zE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9304cb5a-3034-4420-b784-796d60ec7736","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"eskkは辞書ファイルを変換してキャッシュしていたかな","ts":"1634773096.174700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cVqLD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48bc0fc3-7838-4ed5-8617-68bf9675b412","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"パース済みの辞書を読み込むのは面白いアイディアだと思います。","ts":"1634772909.172800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8vRN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc42e293-c1e5-4059-8b12-1ed8e72fdde0","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"skkeletonの辞書読み込みについてですが、正規表現によるパースで線形オーダーでパースしているように読めます。パースアルゴリズムとしては、おそらくこれ以上の高速化は望めないでしょう。\n\n変換候補のルックアップは定数時間で行われているためトライ木にしても、ルックアップ単体の速度向上には貢献せずにメモリの消費を減らしてGCにかかる時間がなくなるくらいだと思います。V8のGCではStopTheWorldは発生しにくいので（\u003chttps://medium.com/voodoo-engineering/nodejs-internals-v8-garbage-collector-a6eca82540ec|https://medium.com/voodoo-engineering/nodejs-internals-v8-garbage-collector-a6eca82540ec\u003e ）そこもなんとも言えないですね。補完候補探索には、ただトライ木が有効かと思うのでやって見る価値は十分にありますね。","ts":"1634772838.171400","attachments":[{"fallback":"Medium: NodeJs internals: V8 \u0026amp; garbage collector","id":1,"title":"NodeJs internals: V8 \u0026amp; garbage collector","title_link":"https://medium.com/voodoo-engineering/nodejs-internals-v8-garbage-collector-a6eca82540ec","text":"Understand memory and garbage collector in NodeJs applications.","image_url":"https://miro.medium.com/max/960/1*VQvZ6fC09gKqphkSNxC1Pw.png","fields":[{"title":"Reading time","value":"7 min read","short":true}],"blocks":null,"ts":1554909545,"service_name":"Medium","service_icon":"https://miro.medium.com/fit/c/152/152/1*sHhtYhaCe2Uc3IU0IgKwIQ.png","from_url":"https://medium.com/voodoo-engineering/nodejs-internals-v8-garbage-collector-a6eca82540ec","original_url":"https://medium.com/voodoo-engineering/nodejs-internals-v8-garbage-collector-a6eca82540ec"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/9T3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0644f7ea-20b3-4928-bfe5-bfc75593efff","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"skkeletonについては辞書の内部構造をトライにして、それをダンプしたものを高速に読めれば全部解決しそうな予感してる","ts":"1634772336.161100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"426cV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49a1cb49-4921-4ccc-8b02-ea9e56d9c6b9","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"eskk.vimはVim scriptが遅いから変換でもかけない限りどうにもならんだろうな…","ts":"1634772096.159700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y+pbg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f85c548e-0c7e-462f-ba1a-9d116e8df468","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"ESKKの該当箇所です","ts":"1634771901.158200","edited":{"user":"U02BDFBM620","ts":"1634771914.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"exG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c90852c-b57f-4d0f-99d2-7a97d6780b0f","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-skk/eskk.vim/blob/d62ead2df16b04b0684caf68f6a5787bca68e17e/autoload/eskk/dictionary.vim#L992|https://github.com/vim-skk/eskk.vim/blob/d62ead2df16b04b0684caf68f6a5787bca68e17e/autoload/eskk/dictionary.vim#L992\u003e","ts":"1634771883.157700","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-skk/eskk.vim/blob/d62ead2df16b04b0684caf68f6a5787bca68e17e/autoload/eskk/dictionary.vim | dictionary.vim\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-skk/eskk.vim/blob/d62ead2df16b04b0684caf68f6a5787bca68e17e/autoload/eskk/dictionary.vim | dictionary.vim\u003e","text":"```\nfunction! s:PhysicalDict_search_candidate(key_filter, okuri_rom) abort dict \"{{{\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-skk/eskk.vim|vim-skk/eskk.vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"isM/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"410f773f-3410-4eae-be39-ab2d41fd06a2","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"節をユーザーが区切って入力するSKKは、変換に使われる１チャンクが小さくなりやすいため、本来大きな辞書を使うこと自体が想定されていない入力方法です。なので、全部入りのでかいSKK-JISYOを使う僕が亜流であるため、この問題をIME側のアルゴリズムで解決する必要はないという気持ちです","ts":"1634771863.157500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"65Wl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dee41c7d-c846-47f3-972a-9417a4d31779","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"今は全く必要ない候補まで見てしまっているのでカットする必要がある","ts":"1634771760.154600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HgCmb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19f10c40-9824-4a44-b3f0-61a6d4730c3c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"補完については辞書の内部形式を直したら一段階速くなると思ってるのでそれはそのうちやりたい(やることが無限に増えていく)","ts":"1634771703.153100","thread_ts":"1634771703.153100","edited":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1634771718.000000"},"reply_count":3,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NYsq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57b00956-0cf3-46e2-bc5a-ec76a2e81b64","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"eskkは候補探索にバイナリサーチあるいは線形サーチを行うので変換のたびに辞書のサイズnに対してlognもしくはnのオーダーで探索をするので、辞書が大きければどんどん遅くなります。変換候補探索にハッシュテーブルを使うskkeletonは定数時間で探索を行うことができると期待されますが、補完候補探索は線形探索なので、やっぱり遅いです。","ts":"1634771622.151000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jJWas"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e199a55a-a633-46df-a8ca-a8ac7aa09ccb","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ついでにこっそり埋めてしまってたバグ直した","ts":"1634771573.149900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2oDn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63b14e91-077d-438b-8b58-fa90a413e025","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"skkeletonの補完機能がflakyだったの直してみました、pum.vim使われている方は同時にバージョンアップお願いします","ts":"1634771552.149600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":2,"users":["U02BDFBM620","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oiiX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36acb17e-6b5c-40cb-bba3-ac5d080a99eb","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"とはいえ、おかげで一度読むと速い","ts":"1634770231.142900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E2FkK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"288f69b7-f14f-4857-9be8-8fb2bfe6b04d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"改善したい所の1つ","ts":"1634770155.142400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jAbi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"108ad081-bc7f-4983-b035-78e69559ece5","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"skkeletonはアホみたいに全部読んでパースしてるので遅い","ts":"1634770148.142000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich